Looking at this problem, I need to maximize $f(a) = a e^{-a\sqrt{2r}} \int_0^\infty \exp\left(-\frac{1}{2}x^2 - \frac{\lambda(a-S_0)^2}{\sigma^2 x^2}\right)dx$ over $a > 0$.

